flowchart TD
    A[Store signals]
    A1[Customer arrivals]
    A2[Queue state]
    A3[Transaction / service times]
    A4[Scan-and-go usage]
    A5[Time + day + historical patterns]

    A --> D[Store State]
    A1 --> D
    A2 --> D
    A3 --> D
    A4 --> D
    A5 --> D

    D --> C[Congestion Prediction]
    D --> F[Demand Forecast]
    D --> I[Inventory Status]

    C --> P[Predicted congestion / wait]
    F --> Q[Predicted product demand]
    I --> R[Stockout risk]

    P --> E[Decision Engine]
    Q --> E
    R --> E

    E --> W[Recommended actions]
    W --> W1[Promote / route customers to Scan-and-Go]
    W --> W2[Prepare assisted checkout]
    W --> W3[Restock products]
    W --> W4[Prepare cold stock]

    W --> H[Staff Dashboard]
    H --> G{Advanced: Operations Agent}
    G --> T[Call approved tools / APIs]
    T --> H
    H --> M[Action taken]
    M --> Z[Measure outcome]
    Z --> D
